OL,3,GNEWSACity's largest independent brewery
OL,4,Aset for move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe biggest independent beer maker in
OL,7,FNottingham has confirmed it will be
OL,8,Fmoving its main site after planning
OL,9,Fpermission was granted for a new
OL,10,Fbrewery.
OL,12,FCastle Rock Brewery said it will close
OL,13,Fits current brewery off Traffic Street
OL,14,Fonce the lease expires next year, and
OL,15,Fopen a new base at Percy Street in
OL,16,FBasford, in a 19th Century Grade II
OL,17,Flisted building once home to Prince of
OL,18,FWales Brewery.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
