OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACity's largest independent brewery
OL,4,Aset for move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company - which also operates pubs
OL,7,Faround Nottingham and across the
OL,8,Fcountry - confirmed the Vat and Fiddle
OL,9,Fpub next to the current brewery will
OL,10,Fstay, with both sites set to brew while
OL,11,Fthe transition takes place.
OL,13,FMarketing manager Jessica Bailey said
OL,14,Fthe move "represents a big opportunity
OL,15,Ffor us".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
